    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n51132" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">vīsĭtātĭo</span></b> ,
			ōnis, f.
		visito. * <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<i>A sight</i>, <i>appearance</i>, <i><span class="en">Vitr. 9, 4 <i>fin.</i></span></i>—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
